{
  "//": "cut from a recorded list_issues response, read 2026-09-18; trimmed to the fields the case asserts; owner, repository, login, ids and URLs replaced with the canonical subject; the last three routes are connection setup, which this case runs first because a page it reads asks for at most the instance's stated maximum page size: the version and the API document as the connection read's own fixture serves them, and that maximum, cut from a recorded settings_api response, the answer codeberg.org gave anonymously, read 2026-10-02",
